    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$3.55 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost) for a coconut curry that Thai takeout would charge $14 for before the delivery fees pile on. Fourteen bowls here costs roughly what two delivered ones do.",
